==History==
2021
*The Archer Queen [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 27/10/2021, in the [[Version History#Champions Update (27/10/2021)|Champions Update]].
*On 1/11/2021, an [[Version History#Optional%20Update%20(1/11/2021)|Optional Update]], fixed some Archer Queen invisibility issues.
*On 4/11/2021, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (4/11/2021)|maintenance break]], increased the Cloaking Cape's cooldown time to 15 seconds (from 11 seconds) and decreased its duration to 3 seconds (from 3.5 seconds).
*On 15/11/2021, a [[Version History#Minor%20Update%20(15/11/2021)|Minor Update]], allowed the [[Mega Knight]] to deal damage to an Archer Queen if she begins cloaking during his jump.
2022
*On 3/2/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(3/2/2022)|Balance Update]], made it so that Cloaking Cape would decrease her speed to 45 (now classified as Slow) when active.
*On 4/4/2022, the [[Version History#April%202022%20Update%20(4/4/2022)|April 2022 Update]], decreased the Cloaking Cape's attack speed buff to 180% (from 200%).
*On 8/4/2022, a [[Version History#Maintenance%20Break%20(8/4/2022)|maintenance break]], fixed an issue where an invisible Archer Queen was not receiving splash damage.
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Archer Queen from [[Training Camp]] to Royal Crypt. This also made it so that players at any King Level could unlock the Archer Queen, as opposed to only Level 14.
2023
*On 7/2/2023, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/2/2023)|Balance Update]], increased the Archer Queen's first attack time interval to 0.3 seconds (from 0.1 seconds).
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2024
*On 3/1/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/1/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the Cloaking Cape's duration to 3.5 seconds (from 3 seconds).
2025
*On 8/1/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/1/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Cloaking Cape's cool down time to 17 seconds (from 15 seconds).
*On 24/11/2025, the [[Version History#Level 16 Update (24/11/2025)|Level 16 Update]] increased the Level Cap of all cards to 16 (from 15).

